ld-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1456397-red-talons-in-earthblood?p=1456411#post1456411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Are there more citations to this event through the game? Because without actual experience with the game to say otherwise (are there any flashbacks with images of that kidnapping perhaps?) i could see it as someone screwing up with the words and using &amp;quot;child&amp;quot; when they meant &amp;quot;cub&amp;quot;, specially if english is not the first language of some people in the production team.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea I get what you mean. This post is just some fun conspiracy , what we see in earthblood can be' only some bad writing. Today I will check better the options with Onawa and I will quote them to you","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-09T04:56:38-07:00","id":1456415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1456397-red-talons-in-earthblood?p=145641